---
import { demos } from "../data/site";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const first = demos[0];
---

<figure class="interactive-demo" data-demo data-base={base}>
  <div class="demo-tasks" role="tablist" aria-label="Demo tasks"><span class="demo-tasks-label">LIBERO examples</span>
    {demos.map((demo, index) => (
      <button role="tab" type="button" id={`task-${demo.id}`} aria-controls="demo-panel" aria-selected={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"} tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1}
        data-id={demo.id} data-label={demo.title} data-task={demo.task} data-oxygen={demo.oxygenS} data-baseline={demo.baselineS}>
        {demo.title}
      </button>
    ))}
  </div>
  <div id="demo-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`task-${first.id}`}>
    <div class="demo-panes demo-pane-heads">
      <div><strong>OxyGen</strong><span>Inference <b data-demo-inference="oxygen">—</b> <small data-demo-inference-speedup="oxygen"></small> · End-to-end <b data-demo-duration="oxygen">{first.oxygenS.toFixed(1)} s</b> <small data-demo-e2e-speedup="oxygen"></small></span></div>
      <div><strong>Isolated baseline</strong><span>Inference <b data-demo-inference="baseline">—</b> · End-to-end <b data-demo-duration="baseline">{first.baselineS.toFixed(1)} s</b></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-video-wrap"><video muted playsinline preload="metadata" poster={`${base}posters/${first.id}-interactive.webp`} data-demo-video
      aria-label={`${first.title}: synchronized OxyGen and isolated baseline replay`}>
      <source src={`${base}videos/${first.id}-interactive.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
    </video><button type="button" class="demo-pause-overlay" data-demo-overlay aria-label="Play demo"><span></span><span></span></button></div>
    <div class="demo-panes demo-statuses">
      {['oxygen', 'baseline'].map(side => <div><span class="demo-phase" data-demo-phase={side}>Loading replay…</span><span class="demo-inference-elapsed" data-demo-inference-elapsed={side}>Inference 0.00 s</span><span class="demo-step" data-demo-step={side}></span><div class="demo-output-box" data-demo-output-box={side}><span class="demo-output-label">OUTPUT:</span> <span data-demo-output-text={side}>—</span><button type="button" class="demo-output-expand" data-demo-output={side} disabled>expand batch</button></div><div class="demo-output-popover" data-demo-output-popover={side} hidden></div></div>)}
    </div>
    <div class="demo-playback">
      <button type="button" class="demo-play" data-demo-play disabled aria-label="Play demo"><span class="icon-play"></span></button>
      <span class="demo-clock"><output data-demo-clock>0.00</output> / <span data-demo-total>{first.baselineS.toFixed(2)}</span> s</span>
      <span class="demo-scrub-hint">Drag to compare at any moment</span>
      <div class="demo-phase-key" aria-label="Timeline legend"><span data-kind="action">Action inference</span><span data-kind="language">Language inference</span><span data-kind="move">Execution</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-timeline">
      <div class="demo-track-names"><span>OxyGen</span><span>Baseline</span></div>
      <div class="demo-tracks" data-demo-tracks>
        <div class="demo-track" data-demo-track="oxygen"></div>
        <div class="demo-track" data-demo-track="baseline"></div>
        <span class="demo-playhead" data-demo-playhead></span>
        <input type="range" data-demo-seek min="0" max={first.baselineS} step="any" value="0" disabled aria-label="Shared replay time in seconds" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <noscript><p><a href={`${base}videos/${first.id}.mp4`}>Watch the annotated comparison video</a>.</p></noscript>
    <p class="demo-error" data-demo-error hidden>Replay data could not be loaded. <a href={`${base}videos/${first.id}.mp4`} data-demo-fallback>Watch the annotated video</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="demo-caption">
    <p>The baseline finishes each language response before moving. OxyGen carries language generation across action updates.</p>
    <div class="demo-details-wrap"><button type="button" class="demo-details-toggle" data-demo-details aria-expanded="false">Measurement details</button><div class="demo-details-popover" data-demo-details-popover hidden><p>Both runs use the same frozen π<sub>0.5</sub> policy and task; OxyGen changes the inference schedule and KV-cache handling, not the policy or target actions. It does not change the target actions. Action inference, language inference, and execution are shown as separate phases reconstructed from the logged run.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/air-embodied-brain/OxyGen/blob/main/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Timing and hardware details in the repo README ↗</a></p></div></div>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
